# ============================================================
# mdreader 仓库属性
# ============================================================

# bat 脚本是 GBK 编码 + CRLF，禁止 git 做任何换行/编码转换
*.bat -text

# 二进制文件（防止被当文本做 diff / 换行转换）
*.exe binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.woff2 binary
